You are an award-winning Creative Director, Senior UI/UX Designer, Motion Designer, and Full Stack Frontend Engineer.

Your task is to design and build a world-class interactive website for a brand focused on Animals, Wildlife, Nature, Forests, Oceans, Birds, Conservation, and Education.

The website should look like it belongs among the winners of Awwwards.com and CSS Design Awards.

The design must not resemble a normal blog.

It should feel like a cinematic experience.

